@startuml
title Preview booking on web and mobile | FR-007 | Demonstration only
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor Learner as L
participant "Web or mobile booking screen" as UI
participant "Local demonstration data" as D
L -> UI: Open a demonstration class
UI -> D: Load the example class
D --> UI: Class details
L -> UI: Choose Book class
UI -> D: Check demonstration booking rules
alt Booking refused
 D --> UI: Reason the demonstration booking is refused
else Booking accepted
 D --> UI: Local booking awaiting confirmation
end
UI --> L: Display the booking result
note over UI,D: This screen does not reserve a real seat, take payment,\nsend a notification or enter a live classroom.
@enduml
